# Rahnoxa Backend Environment Variables (Render Web Service)

NODE_ENV=production
PORT=10000
SITE_URL=https://rahnoxa.com
CORS_ORIGINS=https://rahnoxa.com,https://www.rahnoxa.com,https://rahnoxa.pages.dev

# Database (Supabase PostgreSQL)
